		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-15" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:72pt;margin-top:7pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt;widows:2;margin-top:7pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">(f)&#x00a0;<FONT STYLE="width: 30px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>reduce its share capital and any capital redemption reserve fund subject to any consent, order, Court approval or other matter required by law.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-17" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:7pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt;widows:2;margin-top:7pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">19.2<FONT STYLE="width: 23px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>All new shares created hereunder shall be subject to the same provisions with reference to the payment of calls, liens, transfer, transmission, forfeiture and otherwise as the shares in the original share capital.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-17" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:7pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt;widows:2;margin-top:7pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-3" STYLE="font-size:10pt;">19.3<FONT STYLE="width: 23px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>Subject to the provisions of the Companies Act, the Company may by Special Resolution change its name or alter its objects.</FONT></P>
